            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只勾你确认新主题也支持这些选项的项。错误地搬进去会让新主题加载失败。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only check items you know the new theme supports. Misapplying values can break the new theme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "migrationSheet.skip": {
      "comment": "",
